      "id": "transfer.task.create",
      "state": "modeled",
      "summary": {
        "zh-cn": "只建未启动的 native table 有界快照任务，目标仅 replace/append；标准类型及配置校验不证明实际值可转换或执行成功，不是 Transfer 全功能声明",
        "en": "Create only a stopped native table bounded snapshot task with replace/append; standard type and configuration checks do not prove value conversion or execution success, nor full Transfer coverage"
      },
